 Dynamic Path Mapping

## Variables
- [P] = Project/Solution name
- [F] = Feature name (PascalCase)
- [A] = Action name (PascalCase)

## Backend (.NET) - See `@dev/rules/stack/backend.md`
### Core Structure
- **Entity**: `src/[P].Domain/Entities/[F].cs`
- **Interface**: `src/[P].Domain/Interfaces/I[F]Service.cs`
- **Request**: `src/[P].Application/Models/[F]/Requests/[A]Request.cs`
- **Response**: `src/[P].Application/Models/[F]/Responses/[A]Response.cs`
- **Service**: `src/[P].Infrastructure/Services/[F]Service.cs`
- **Controller**: `src/[P].API/Controllers/[F]Controller.cs`

### Support Structure
- **Constants**: `src/[P].Domain/Constants/[F]Constants.cs`
- **Enums**: `src/[P].Domain/Enums/[F]Enums.cs`
- **Extensions**: `src/[P].Domain/Extensions/[F]Extensions.cs`
- **Helpers**: `src/[P].Application/Helpers/[F]Helper.cs`
- **Validators**: `src/[P].Application/Validators/[F]/[A]RequestValidator.cs`

## Frontend (Angular) - See `@dev/rules/stack/frontend.md`
### Core Structure
- **Component**: `src/app/features/[F]/components/[A]/`
- **Service**: `src/app/features/[F]/services/[F].service.ts`
- **Model**: `src/app/shared/models/[F].model.ts`

### Support Structure
- **Constants**: `src/app/shared/constants/[F].constants.ts`
- **Enums**: `src/app/shared/enums/[F].enum.ts`
- **Utils**: `src/app/shared/utils/[F].util.ts`
- **Guards**: `src/app/features/[F]/guards/[F].guard.ts`
- **Interceptors**: `src/app/core/interceptors/[F].interceptor.ts`

## Tests
- **Unit**: `tests/[P].Tests/[F]/[F]ServiceTests.cs`
- **Integration**: `tests/[P].IntegrationTests/[F]/[F]ControllerTests.cs`
- **E2E**: `tests/[P].E2ETests/[F]/[F].spec.ts`

## Data layer - See `@dev/rules/stack/data.md`
**Entities** follow Domain paths, **DTOs** follow Application paths above